        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Countryballs at War</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Countryballs at War</strong> is a grand strategy wargame where you command a countryball nation and fight for domination. Combine turn-based empire building with real-time battles, expand your territories, and rise as the ultimate superpower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique blend of strategy and action, every decision matters. Manage your diplomacy, build your armies, and prepare for unexpected challenges across a fully playable world map. Lead any countryball you want, unlock hidden nations, and carve your path to global supremacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face rivals eager to claim your land, unexpected world events that force you to adapt, and the constant need to balance diplomacy with military might. Whether you prefer conquering by force or forging powerful alliances, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own stories with the <strong>custom campaign editor</strong>, replay historical campaigns, or experiment with every nation’s unique strengths. <i>Countryballs at War</i> offers both casual fun for newcomers and deep strategic layers for seasoned strategy fans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All Countries Playable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose any countryball to lead. Some nations start locked, but can be discovered and unlocked by exploring the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767910/extras/f6b57f0432760f0e4cd3ca0a04f92ea7.poster.avif?t=1761114076\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767910/extras/f6b57f0432760f0e4cd3ca0a04f92ea7.webm?t=1761114076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767910/extras/f6b57f0432760f0e4cd3ca0a04f92ea7.mp4?t=1761114076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-Based Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend limited <strong>Attack Points</strong> and <strong>Diplomacy Points</strong> each turn to expand or negotiate. Careful planning is essential—every turn presents tough choices between conquest, diplomacy, and development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767910/extras/39d570160ea3962ec67de1336cba4c85.poster.avif?t=1761114076\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767910/extras/39d570160ea3962ec67de1336cba4c85.webm?t=1761114076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767910/extras/39d570160ea3962ec67de1336cba4c85.mp4?t=1761114076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-Time Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take direct control of your armies in live combat. Coordinate attacks, call allies for reinforcements, and outmaneuver enemies with superior tactics to achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767910/extras/cdfc3ee99bb386fac5e69968c6cc437b.poster.avif?t=1761114076\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767910/extras/cdfc3ee99bb386fac5e69968c6cc437b.webm?t=1761114076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767910/extras/cdfc3ee99bb386fac5e69968c6cc437b.mp4?t=1761114076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Campaign Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and play your own campaigns with the in-game editor. Create scenarios, set objectives, and challenge yourself or the community with unique stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767910/extras/660752100c6890015dede0cfa3700425.poster.avif?t=1761114076\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767910/extras/660752100c6890015dede0cfa3700425.webm?t=1761114076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767910/extras/660752100c6890015dede0cfa3700425.mp4?t=1761114076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Campaigns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive key moments of history through official campaigns. From great wars to unique scenarios, each campaign offers a fresh challenge and perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767910/extras/1d4e9ebd3af818aa3e7db362a3c15e80.poster.avif?t=1761114076\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767910/extras/1d4e9ebd3af818aa3e7db362a3c15e80.webm?t=1761114076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767910/extras/1d4e9ebd3af818aa3e7db362a3c15e80.mp4?t=1761114076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diplomacy &amp; Conquest</strong>: Declare war, sign treaties, form alliances, and puppet nations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Units &amp; Upgrades</strong>: Train infantry, artillery, and nation-specific units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Events &amp; Challenges</strong>: React to dynamic events like pirate invasions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offline Single-Player</strong>: Enjoy the full game offline, anytime, anywhere.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Community &amp; Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is updated with new content, units, and improvements. Join the community on Discord to share feedback, discuss strategies, and stay up to date with the latest news.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map Music: <i>“Gates of Glory”</i> by Alexander Nakarada  – Licensed under CC BY 4.0</p>",
